    <help sid="HelpCommercialProperty_Premises_CoinsurancePercent_G">
      <value>Enter percentage: The Coinsurance Percentage is the percentage of the total value of the subject of insurance being insured.  If the amount of insurance falls below this percentage, the insured must share in the amount of the loss.  This field should be completed even when writing agreed amount coverage. </value>
    </help>
