      <next>CommercialProperty_Premises_CauseOfLossCode_G</next>
    </field>
    <help sid="HelpCommercialProperty_Premises_ValuationCode_G">
      <value>Enter code: Indicate the method which will be used to determine the amount paid on a claim.  If other valuation basis applies, provide necessary information.

Example valuation methods are:

A -  Actual Cash Value
R  - Replacement Cost
V -  Agreed Amount
M - Market Value </value>
    </help>
